<page-meta page-style="{{themeStyle}}" />
<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !info}}" class="status">正在读取…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>

  <block wx:if="{{info}}">
    <view class="hero grad-card">
      <view class="hero-label">{{info.active ? '会员有效中 · 你们两个人共用' : '还不是会员'}}</view>
      <view class="hero-value">{{info.active ? untilText : '开通会员'}}</view>
      <view class="hero-sub">{{info.active ? '这天到期，到期后不会自动续费' : '一个人开通，两个人都能用'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">会员权益</view></view>
      <view class="list">
        <view wx:for="{{perks}}" wx:key="title" class="list-row"><view class="row-main"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="row-sub">{{item.sub}}</view></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">{{info.active ? '续费' : '选择套餐'}}</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!info.available}}" class="notice">会员购买还没开通，请稍后再来。</view>
      <view class="list">
        <view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row plan" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pick" hover-class="list-row-active" aria-role="radio" aria-checked="{{item.id === selected}}" aria-label="{{item.name}} {{item.price}}">
          <view class="tick"><view class="tick-box {{item.id === selected ? 'tick-on' : ''}}">{{item.id === selected ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view>
          <view class="row-main"><view class="row-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="row-sub">{{item.days}} 天</view></view>
          <view class="plan-price">{{item.price}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <button class="primary buy" bindtap="buy" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !info.available}}">{{info.active ? '续费' : '开通'}} {{selectedPrice}}</button>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">购买须知</view></view>
      <view class="card terms">
        <view>1. 会员属于你们的小家：一个人开通，两个人都能用。</view>
        <view>2. {{plansText}}，从付款成功起算；没到期时续费，接着原到期日往后加。</view>
        <view>3. 一次性购买，到期后不会自动续费，也不会自动扣款。</view>
        <view>4. 通过微信虚拟支付购买，iPhone 上由苹果代收。付款后一般几秒内生效，没生效请下拉刷新。</view>
        <view>5. 会员是虚拟商品，购买后不支持退款，未用完的天数也不能折现或转让。付了款没开通，请在右上角「···」→「反馈与投诉」联系我们。</view>
        <view>6. 手动记账、两人同步等基础功能一直免费，会员只增加各项喵喵 AI 功能（截图记账、喵喵小结、一句话加清单、吃啥帮我挑、纪念日点子）的每日次数。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <view class="page-end"></view>
</view>
